OL,3,AHigh voter turnout for Israel election
OL,4,Awith two hours until polls due to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FA party must hold 61 to have a
OL,7,Fmajority, but this has never happened
OL,8,Fin the country's history and
OL,9,Fgovernments are typically made up of
OL,10,Fcoalitions
OL,12,FIsraeli exit polls are expected as soon
OL,13,Fas polls close, with preliminary
OL,14,Fresults expected on Wednesday -
OL,15,Fofficial results are scheduled to be
OL,16,Fpublished at the start of November
OL,18,FPolling released on Friday suggests
OL,19,Fincumbent Benjamin Netanyahu is almost
OL,20,Fneck-and-neck with former military
OL,21,Fchief Gadi Eisenkot in the race to
OL,22,Fbecome prime minister
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
